{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_ogarniacz_github_workflow_skill", "label": "Ogarniacz GitHub Workflow Skill", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/ogarniacz-github-workflow/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Commit, push, PR i release s\u0105 osobnymi operacjami o osobnych zgodach; znajomo\u015b\u0107 Git/GitHub nie jest zgod\u0105 na publikacj\u0119 APK, aktualizacj\u0119 Raspberry Pi ani deploy."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_ogarniacz_github_workflow_skill_commit_scope_discipline", "label": "Zakres commita ograniczony do plik\u00f3w zadania", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/ogarniacz-github-workflow/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zastane zmiany u\u017cytkownika zachowuje si\u0119 poza w\u0142asnym commitem, a indeks i bia\u0142e znaki sprawdza si\u0119 przed zapisem SHA."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_ogarniacz_github_workflow_skill_authorized_push", "label": "Autoryzowany push bez wymuszania historii", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/ogarniacz-github-workflow/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Przy odrzuceniu sprawdza si\u0119 aktualny stan zamiast \u015blepych ponowie\u0144; rozbie\u017cno\u015bci historii nie rozwi\u0105zuje si\u0119 nadpisaniem pracy u\u017cytkownika."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_ogarniacz_github_workflow_skill_ci_status_by_sha", "label": "Odczyt CI dla dok\u0142adnego SHA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/ogarniacz-github-workflow/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Status czyta si\u0119 z istniej\u0105cych uruchomie\u0144 powi\u0105zanych z konkretnym SHA; brak workflow nie oznacza zielonego CI, a